### Product API
### Get All Products (Default: page=1, limit=10)
GET http://localhost:3000/products HTTP/1.1

### Get Products with Category Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/products?category=electronics HTTP/1.1

### Get Products with Search Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/products?search=phone HTTP/1.1

### Get Products with Both Category and Search
GET http://localhost:3000/products?category=electronics&search=keyboard HTTP/1.1

### Get Products with Pagination (Page 2, Limit 5)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?page=2&limit=5 HTTP/1.1


#### Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/products/3 HTTP/1.1


### 1. Create Product as Admin (Success: 201)
